WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:10.400
I heard from Dela that there are two Witch Frogs in the Human World named Majo Rika and Majo Ruka.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:16.170
They turned into Witch Frogs, and yet they still stay in the Human World? You don't see that every day.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.540
They should be living here, it's so much more fun.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.330
A storm that comes once every 300 years.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.790
I hope nothing bad happens.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.610
Something terrible has happened, Your Majesty.

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:21.130
What's the matter?

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:25.360
The lightning has destroyed the lock on one of our doors.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:28.290
A group of Witch Frogs has been blown into the Human World.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.880
This is most troubling.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.260
So Many Witch Frogs!

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.050
Such a delicious crab...

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.420
What... ish thish place?

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:09.930
Where... in shuh worhld am I...?

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.300
Whozis?

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:42.090
You got some nerve, snoring at me.

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:49.620
What the heck is this!?

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.510
I overslept again!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.750
Hey, Doremi! Come look at the TV!

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.460
What's this, so early in the morning?

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:00.150
I have no time!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:06.140
Last night, a robber broke into the office of Segawa Onpu-chan, the popular idol.

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:11.730
There's no doubt about it! This was caused by a Bad Item!

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.510
There he goes again.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:18.370
The report said the place is all messed up, but the thief didn't steal anything.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:21.440
I'm sure one of Onpu-chan's fans did it.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.920
Hey-hey-hey-hey-hey!

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:24.660
How can you diss me like that!?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.550
Oh shut it.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:30.120
You just want to see Onpu-chan, right?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.400
What are you saying?

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.740
I really do sense a Bad Item!

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.840
Now, hurry and take me to Onpu-chan's office!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:44.550
But Onpu-chan probably won't be at her office now.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:46.760
Really?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.470
Are you an idiot?

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:51.790
Ya should take a look in the mirror first!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.640
Even you laugh at me!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.350
Can't you erase that mustache?

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.560
It's an oil-based pen, so she can't wipe it off.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.530
You should be able to with some grease.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:04.390
Okay, since you all suspect me so much,

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.240
I won't say anything else!

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:10.590
But if you leave me like this, I don't know what will happen to that girl.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:12.700
Hey, are you really telling the truth?

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.460
Am I?

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:21.310
If he is, then Onpu-chan really is in trouble.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.460
I think we should go check it out.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:35.600
Even if there really is a Bad Card there, there is no need to help Majo Ruka's apprentice.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.810
Yeah...

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:38.810
We'll still go take a look.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.140
Wait right there!

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.770
Who'll look after the store?

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.000
Jeez, those Ojamajos.

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.180
You really didn't draw this mustache?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.920
I didn't do it!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:53.650
But I had it this morning when I woke up!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:56.180
You're the only other one here.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.220
I shlept well.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.970
Who are you?

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.600
Over there!

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.150
Onpu-chan's office is on the second floor of that building!

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:22.320
No wonder you are the seventh member of her fan club.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.610
Yes? Come in.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.820
Oh? That voice is...

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.160
Sorry to intrude.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.160
Oh?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.870
Onpu-chan, you're here.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:39.170
Doremi-chan, Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.540
And, uhm...

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.470
I'm Harukaze Pop!

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.500
Hello.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.050
She's my sister.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.490
Hello.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:50.090
You seem way more capable than your older sister.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.350
So cute!

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.600
What's this?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.770
It's so cute!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:59.520
Onpu-chan said I'm cute!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.840
Onpu-chan said I'm cute...

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:02.310
Let me see that.
Onpu-chan said I'm cute...

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.690
It looks a bit weird, but it's cute!

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.240
Wow, that was unexpected.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:15.710
This thing is funny.

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:17.240
So why are you here?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.840
Oh yeah.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:21.920
Onpu-chan, do you know about the Bad Items?

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.420
What are the Bad Items?

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:31.880
Um, there was an evil wizard a long time ago that took the Bad Cards and scattered them in the Human World.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.050
Don't worry about that.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.070
Pop is a witch apprentice too.

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:44.550
And those cards fix themselves into things inside the Human World, bringing misfortune to the people who use them.

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:46.070
Those are the Bad Items.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:53.530
And since a robber broke into yer office, we were wonderin' if maybe a Bad Item caused it.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:55.710
Nope!

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:58.700
Unfortunately, it's impossible for a Bad Item to have caused it.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.940
Follow me.

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.250
I'll show you the criminal.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.080
President's Office

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:11.300
Usually only my boss, Majo Ruka, can enter this room.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:13.700
What is it?

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:15.310
It's me.

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:17.490
Doremi-chan and the others came over to visit.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.940
Good timing.

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:19.860
Come in.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.230
Excuse us.

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:32.070
So many Witch Frogs!

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:37.410
Feast your eyes! These are Majo Rika's witch apprentices!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.680
She sure has a lot of them.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:44.520
Yeah, she does!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.080
Let me take a picture.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.980
W-What is all this?

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:51.010
What's going on?

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:56.890
Yesterday, these Witch Frogs were blown here from this door which leads to the Witch World.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:01.550
They all had a party here last night.

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:03.850
It was so wild!

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:19.530
So Onpu-chan also has a door that leads to the Witch World.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:24.000
So the "robbers" were these Witch Frogs.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.040
There ain't a Bad Item here.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:34.760
If the police or the media found out about this, then it'd be curtains for us.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:38.010
Just like Majo Rika!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.550
What did you say?

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:42.770
Someone also drew a mustache on Majo Rika's face.

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.520
Really?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:49.230
But this was drawn by one of the Witch Frogs when she was sleeping.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.110
It must have been Majo Ume-san.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.120
M-Majo Ume-san?

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:04.320
Well, when we came to, Majo Ume-san was gone.

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:08.080
If you know where she is, then take us to her.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:14.130
Yeah, yeah, take us to where she is.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:16.300
Take them, but how?

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.570
Oh yeah, that's a fabulous idea!

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:21.440
They're causing so much trouble here.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:23.280
Shoo, shoo!

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:30.690
They weigh a ton!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.790
Hey, Pop!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.900
Help us out a bit here!

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:39.580
So since she's all soft, I named her Plush-chan!

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:42.120
That's so cute.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.000
They get along pretty well.

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:47.830
Maybe it's because their personalities are similar.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:51.660
Hey, can't you fly slower?

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:54.900
Majo Take-san is about to throw up.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.010
Hey, hey.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:59.320
We'll almost there, so hang in there!

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:24.450
So I think I know the general story, now.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:31.310
You guys were enjoying the nice autumn weather, but a huge storm came that blew you all here to the Human World.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.170
Am IRight?

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.830
Yeah, pretty much.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.340
Then this is easy.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.870
The storm is over already.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:40.840
You can go on home now.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.510
No, how can we go back?

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.010
What did you say!?

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:51.730
It's rare that we come to the Human World, so we want to do some sightseeing before going back.

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.480
S-Sightseeing?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.020
Yes, yes.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.030
The weather is so nice, so take us around.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:01.200
W-Wait! Stop!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.870
If ya go out like that, then you'll cause a ruckus!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:08.700
Well then, why don't you take us somewhere?

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:11.210
Us?

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.020
We're witches.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.880
We're teachers to you witch apprentices!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.630
Y-Yeah...

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:21.220
Of course, it's your job to be our guide.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.930
W-Well, that's a bit...

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:29.310
We've decided that if you don't take us, then we'll stay here forever.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.140
What!?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:34.770
Then you'll be staying in this store for the rest of your lives?

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:36.380
Oh wow.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:38.440
Just take them out for a bit.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.450
N-No way!

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:42.680
Ahh, it's time already!

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:44.920
I have work to do.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.580
Onpu-chan, you're going back?

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:50.650
Yeah. I have to go work at the TV station.

00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:53.410
Hey, if you want to, why don't you come with me, Pop?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.120
Sure, I'll go, I'll go!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.250
What!?

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.290
You're taking Pop?

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.340
Well girls, I'll see you later!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:01.330
See you later!

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:07.010
Now, let's go shopping.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.470
Shopping!?

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.930
Misora Shopping District

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.050
Everyone's staring.

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.920
We look suspicious, that's why.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:22.940
This sucks.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.370
What's that?

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:35.190
Ahh, they're lining up for crepes.

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:36.420
We want some too.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.420
You're eating!?

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.300
Jeez... That used up all my allowance!

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.990
Wow! What a good-looking man!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:52.420
I'm the police!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.480
Let me take a picture.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.650
Surrender in peace!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:05.220
Hey, hey, you'll be discovered if you're too loud.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.610
That's fine, Japan's number one!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:10.070
Do you want some?

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.700
Sure, thank you.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.860
Here I go.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:58.850
Ah! Majo Rika!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.710
Are you done yet?

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:05.380
It'll get dark soon, so please go back to the Witch World.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.240
What are you saying?

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.580
The fun has only just begun!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:10.840
Next on the list is the hot springs!

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.740
We won't go back without going to the hot springs.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.270
Yeah, yeah!

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:21.520
You guys... Stop getting cocky!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:25.120
But are there any hot springs near us?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:29.920
There's no other way.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:32.660
I'll take you to my secret spot.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.370
What's that?

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.290
So nice!

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:48.010
It used to be only me and the monkeys.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.930
Hey, I've always wanted to ask this.

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.220
But where are your witch apprentices?

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.180
We don't have any.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:03.190
The ones who found us out got so scared and ran away.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:04.990
Then...

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.400
Ya can't turn back to witches?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.110
Yeah, that's how it is.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:15.260
We came from the Village of Witch Frogs.

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:16.840
The Village of Witch Frogs?

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:21.180
Yeah, all those frogs who can't turn back to normal are there.

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:24.020
It's a good place, that village.

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:28.500
Rika-san, why don't you come live with us?

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.840
Yeah, yeah, that's a good idea.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.220
Thank you for your offer, but I'm fine.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:40.190
But I've heard that Majo Ruka wanted to live in the Village of Witch Frogs.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.600
I still want to play some more.

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.520
Where should we go next?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.240
Ya still wanna go somewhere?

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.130
Okay, let's go to the amusement park.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.110
The amusement park?

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:59.480
Yes. I became a Witch Frog before I could visit an amusement park.

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.540
It's one of the things I've always wanted to do.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.950
Well, okay, but it's gettin' late.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.270
We may not make it if we go now.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:08.570
Then we won't go home.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.210
Yeah, yeah.

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:14.970
If you don't take us to the amusement park, we won't go back.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.180
Oh wow, there they go again.

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:22.140
If you don't take us there now, we will lounge here forever.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.600
Oh no, you won't! Not at <i>my </i> store!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.210
What should we do?

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:28.370
Maybe we can use magic.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.110
Okay, let's try it.

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:38.110
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:44.840
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.390
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.470
Magical Stage!

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:10.690
Take us to the amusement park!

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.830
What's this?

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.120
A toy amusement park?

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:24.290
I guess this is the limit of our magic.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.360
Good, good.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.490
Well then, let us have some fun.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.090
Oh, you can use magic.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:38.520
Of course.

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:40.480
We are witches, you know.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:47.310
It's not moving.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.900
Then just use magic.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.150
What's this?

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.740
Let's see...

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.820
This is great, this is great! Turn it more!

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.540
Okay, here I go.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.270
Doremi-chan, let me try too.

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:14.920
Okay.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:15.880
Me too!

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:32.380
It's so late already!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.070
I'm home.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:42.320
Doremi! What time do you think it is!?

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.550
I'm sorry.

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:47.620
Pop was able to come home on time.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:57.020
Actually, Onpu-chan checked the time and sent me home on time.

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:59.340
Wow, Doremi, you're so careless.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:03.110
So, what happened?

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:04.800
Did they all go back?

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.600
Well...

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.560
Come play at our village next time.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:12.520
Okay.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.680
I'm a bit jealous of you.

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:18.020
You have witch apprentices looking after you.

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:19.830
Come play anytime.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:22.610
They can set it up for you whenever you like.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:28.990
That was fun, thank you!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.780
Take care!

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:35.870
Goodbye!

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:53.480
It's the Queen of the Witch World!

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:05.900
Everyone, thank you for bringing the Witch Frogs back.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.920
I shall give you this as thanks.

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:18.420
Isn't this a sphere of certification?

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:26.890
Spheres of certification are given after passing exams or as thanks from the Witch World.

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:36.310
If the Witch Frogs were not returned, then humans would have found out about the Witch World,

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:38.520
endangering us all.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:42.110
All of you prevented that from happening.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:47.530
Only a few more exams left... Keep trying your best.

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:48.620
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.080
Thank you, Your Majesty!

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:06.340
Hayashi Ryota-kun's favorite thing is the monster Gazamadon!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.840
Rooooaaar~!

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:10.630
But he suddenly says that he doesn't like monsters anymore.

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:11.730
How's that possible?

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:13.330
He loves 'em so much.

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:15.140
I'm sure there's some reason.

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:17.120
Alright, we'll help him out!

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:17.560
Yeah!

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:19.030
Rooooaaar~!

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:20.200
Hadzuki-chan?

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:21.660
Roar~

00:22:22.180 --> 00:22:23.260
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.260 --> 00:22:24.860
Ryota and the Monster of the Night.

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:27.590
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
